agent -> folder: "SKILL.md 본문 읽기"
folder -> agent: "계약 여섯 줄 · 에코 틀"
agent -> folder: "echo-format.md 읽기"
folder -> agent: "에코 틀 · 보기"
agent -> user: "에코 (행동 없음)"
user -> agent: "수정 · 승인"
agent -> user: "저장 위치 셋 제안"
